===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[main]] [[entrance]] to a [[building]] or [[house]], normally fronts onto a [[street]]
# {{lb|en|computing}} The normal [[portal]] page to a [[website]].
# {{lb|en|baseball}} The path of a [[pitch]] which starts inside and then slides over the [[plate]].
#: ''His '''front door''' slider is hard to handle.''
# {{lb|en|slang}} [[vagina]]

